<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>回到开场</Text><Box style={{height: 620, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 80px"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", alignItems: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>谁批</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>在哪个环境跑</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 29, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>留下什么记录</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 40, textAlign: "center"}}>答得出来的，是你们已经有的；答不出来的那道，就是你要动的地方。</Text><Box style={{width: 132, height: 2, background: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 32}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 42, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 28, textAlign: "center"}}>能力看模型，差距看那一圈。</Text></Box></Box>
